{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_08",
  "title": "童話的開場",
  "storyCode": "SS-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7823c2950220c81a788f72a4a239177d6074e7ce36a81ed8974df715e395eb5e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "從幾十層高的天台往下看，地面上的車與人都渺小如塵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "若麥小姐，我們已經加強了你住處附近的警戒，請你這段時間減少外出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在還沒抓到綁架犯，考慮到你的安全，公司建議你暫停這段時間的活動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "暫停活動……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只是一段時間，我們會重新篩選適合的合作方，以確保你的絕對安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "那喜歡我的粉絲們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "若麥小姐，你現在是龍門當紅的明星，希望你能意識到自己的人氣有多高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "但是……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這段時間你可以休個假，或者做一些自己感興趣的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——唯獨不要亂跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "近衛局又過來聯絡我們了，我需要去應付一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "好好待著，不要亂跑……嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "若麥環顧自己的家——\n如果它能被稱為“家”的話。\n客廳裡永遠只有一個人看的超大電視。\n每天都有人來收拾的床鋪，看起來永遠都是嶄新的。\n突然，她的目光被一樣東西所吸引。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "找到了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "也許並不是刻意遺忘，而是她不願去尋找。\n在某個時刻，是她自己選擇放棄了它。\n那是書櫃角落裡的一副鼓棒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "（敲擊鼓棒）……一、二、三、四。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "……打得好爛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你放走了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你違抗了我的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "老爺，這次的交易算我違約，違約金在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "海鈴從口袋中掏出了一袋金幣，將它放在了老爺面前的桌上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……你拒絕了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "我想了很久，我們還是繼續保持僱傭關係吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "我還是更適合獨來獨往，真的需要有什麼作伴的話，我也想選我的貝斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，你想回去找弗朗西斯他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "我對他們的音樂派對感興趣很久了。對不起，你口中的更大的牌桌，我沒辦法坐上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈……我什麼時候說讓你上牌桌了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你從來都只是“籌碼”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不握在自己手裡的籌碼，一文不值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老爺話音剛落，會客室的門立刻就被推開，一群身材健碩的打手將海鈴團團圍住。\n海鈴將目光移回老爺身上，一把銃已經明晃晃地對準了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小島離船越來越遠，就快從視野中消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "text": "怎麼了？怎麼一直回頭看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "剛才，我好像聽見有誰在叫我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "text": "哈哈，肯定是你聽錯了。海上除了風浪聲和羽獸聲，還能有什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "text": "（觀察）你提這麼多行李，是想去大城市打拼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "……我要去找一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "text": "真巧，怎麼又是一個要找人的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "你說什麼……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "text": "（大聲）海浪突然變大了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不知何時，頭頂的天空變得昏暗起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "text": "（更大聲）危險……抓緊……護欄……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可是一切為時已晚。\n巨浪重重地砸在了甲板上，洶湧的海水瞬間灌入每一個艙室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "不對……不對……不對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "吉他的聲音……不對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可是她心裡非常明白，古典吉他永遠發不出電吉他的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的父親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小聲）小睦，已經很晚了，該睡了哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的父親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小聲）不管怎麼說，請你先把房間門打開吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（小聲）嗯，就和以前一樣，我們陪在你的身邊，講床邊故事給你聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "……不要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "除非你們告訴我，祥……她到底去哪裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們也不知道啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "說不定，她也去了其他地方，找到了自己的幸福呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "……說謊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "祥，不是那樣的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "門外一片寂靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "祥不會這樣輕易改變的，她想要我回到Ave{@nbs}Mujica——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母親",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "text": "小睦也不能輕易改變哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不知何時，媽媽已經站在了睦的身後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睦的母親",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1939_1",
      "text": "這不只是你的夢，也是我們的夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”們",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "我們都是睦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”們",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "這是我們共同的夢，我們都能真實存在、都能幸福的夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”們",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "小睦不需要祥子，小睦只需要我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "不……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”們",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "我們，永遠，永遠，在一起吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "不——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "離之前約定的時間還有十分鐘……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子們",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "愛麗絲姐姐、貝娜姐姐，再見——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "text": "再見，再見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "text": "要遵守我們許下的約定，當一個乖小孩哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子們",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "text": "愛麗絲、貝娜，準備好了嗎？準備好我們就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "等一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "text": "祥子小姐……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "text": "我還以為你不會來了呢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "呼……呼……呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "愛麗絲……項鍊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "text": "項、項鍊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "在你左邊的口袋裡——那條放在小盒子裡的、可以避免做惡夢的項鍊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "text": "祥子小姐，你在說什麼，我沒……欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "愛麗絲下意識地將手伸進了口袋中，沒想到卻感覺到了一絲意外的涼意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "text": "祥子……難道你真的會預言？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "舞台中央，睦倒在了一片血泊之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "孩子！我的孩子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母親",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快點救救她！快點救救她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "導演",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她怎麼樣了？受傷了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女主角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可憐的孩子，她真的死了！太可怕了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男主角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "騙人，她才沒死！這種事情怎麼可能是真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "其他演員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（喧鬧的哼唧聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "其他演員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（興奮的哼唧聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "……沃爾夫，你演得實在太爛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃爾夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "text": "對不起，表演不是我的強項。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡爾頓們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1937_1",
      "text": "（歡樂的嬉笑聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "你們以為自己就演得很好嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡爾頓們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1937_1",
      "text": "（慌亂的哭鬧聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "不行，台上的演員還不夠……還缺一個……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫菲絲死死地盯著舞台的最中央——座椅上，藍髮的少女正閉著眼，但她的眉宇間仍是掙扎的表情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡爾頓們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1937_1",
      "text": "（失落的哼唧聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃爾夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "text": "這部戲是一個敘拉古的劇作家寫的，據說剛上演時，還引起了不小的爭議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "真真假假，假假真真，追究那麼清楚又有什麼意義呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "人總是喜歡對一件事追根究底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃爾夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "text": "或許，這是人之所以為“人”的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃爾夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "text": "對不起，我又多言了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "不……沃爾夫，你能流暢地說話了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃爾夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "text": "或許是最近排演的次數變多……也有可能是最近見到的事情比較多，心中有了一些感悟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "編織的造物也會有“心”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃爾夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "text": "書上說，鐵皮人也能擁有心，我應該也可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "嘖，我就不該讓你看那麼多書……還不如結巴呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "text": "她沒有“心”了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "text": "我能把她再縫補起來，但沒有心的她，就沒辦法再走出這裡了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "text": "你來決定吧……決定莫菲絲的命運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "（愛麗絲姐姐……貝娜姐姐……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "果然，你還是不要說話比較好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "所有人，和我一樣就好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "莫菲絲，你的鬧劇，該結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "舞台上，原本沉睡的人偶站了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "什麼！怎麼回事？這怎麼可能？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "怎麼會這樣！不對啊，你怎麼可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "我說過，在喚醒我的夥伴之前，我不會走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "我給你兩個選擇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "要嘛現在立刻從我眼前消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "要嘛等著我用一層層的夢境把你困住，讓你直接昏迷在“無夢之境”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "我偏不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "你敢？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子將手伸進了口袋中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "（嗯，果然還在。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "愛麗絲的項鍊穿越了層層夢境，陪她來到了這裡。\n現在，她要拯救Ave{@nbs}Mujica，拯救所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "我們的賭約，還沒有結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "在她們的夢裡，我見到了她們每個人的內心所想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "她們心中的願望一一被實現，但她們卻並不幸福。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "她們並非虛偽，只是心中依然迷茫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "身為Ave{@nbs}Mujica的發起者，我向她們許諾了，我會對她們的人生負責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "從我說出這句話開始，我們的命運就緊緊相連在一起……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "面對迷途的人偶，我應當為她們指明方向，我必須帶領她們走出迷霧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "豐川祥子站在舞台中央，環顧身旁沉睡的夥伴們，又將視線轉向莫菲絲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "只是迷途的人偶……也包括你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "月光灑下之時，人偶獲得暫時的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "醒來吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "text": "攔下她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡爾頓們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1937_1",
      "text": "（恐怖的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "既然這裡是我們的夢境，那我們才是這裡的主人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "我們只會成為我們想要成為的樣子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "豐川祥子緩緩抬起了手，她的裝束也隨之變化。\n她回想起夢裡自己學習的源石技藝，回想起自己想要寫的曲子。\n就像她無數次練習的那樣，手指堅定地落下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她的手落在一枚白色琴鍵上。\n音符清晰地傳到了台上台下的每個角落，也讓牽引著人偶的絲線脫力。\n人偶們失去了控制，一個個倒在了巨大的舞台上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "這段時間以來，Ave{@nbs}Mujica的每個人都在努力，我怎麼可以落後呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "即使面對各種困難和麻煩，我們最後不是依然完成了屬於“我們”的化裝舞會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "我想寫一首歌——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "寫我們的掙扎，還有我們未來的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "我們是一個樂隊，是命運共同體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "這就是我的回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”們",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "小睦，放下吉他吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”們",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "你是我們的公主，不論你做什麼，我們都會陪在你的身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“睦”們",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "——摀住她的耳朵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "（抱緊吉他）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "你們不是我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "我真的很想念祥……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerId": "avg_4183_mortis_1",
      "text": "誰能幫幫我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真是拿你沒辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "原本撲在睦身上的“睦”們，像突然失去控制的提線人偶，一個接一個地倒下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然是小睦發自內心的願望，我會好好傾聽的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "全副武裝的打手們，正一點點朝海鈴逼近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "海鈴，該結束了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼回事？這首曲子是……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "海鈴——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "弗朗西斯……你怎麼會從天而降？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "祥子全都跟我們說了，其實我們都是你夢境裡的造物對吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "為什麼你們會相信她說的那些話……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "不，你難道不覺得很合理嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "正因為我們是你創造出來的，所以才會從一開始就那麼相信你啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "自從接受了這件事，我整個人都變輕鬆了。海鈴，我現在簡直無所不能！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "時間不多了，你趕快離開這個惡夢吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "我要怎麼離開……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "這是你的夢境，你肯定知道吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "那我離開以後，你們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "你什麼時候變得這麼扭扭捏捏了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "放心好了，我和兄弟們舉辦派對的時候會好好想念你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "……嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "快走吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別讓她跑了——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "海鈴抓緊琴盒的提手，微微屈膝，將重心慢慢下移——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerId": "avg_4186_tmoris_1",
      "text": "我——走了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗朗西斯&兄弟們",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "海鈴大姐頭，一路順風！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1260_1",
      "text": "若麥小姐……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "音響正用最大音量播放著大家從未聽過的歌。\n而房間裡空無一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1260_1",
      "text": "快點通知保全公司！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "她、她開直播了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1260_1",
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "大家好喵姆喵姆~我是喵姆親~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "喵姆親現在正在龍門上空滑翔！哈哈，後面還有幾十輛警車在追我哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "啊~真開心！喵姆親現在的樣子，大家一輩子都不會忘記吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "如果你們還能留下記憶的話，還有一點也請記住——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerId": "avg_4185_amoris_1",
      "text": "喵姆親是Ave{@nbs}Mujica的鼓手——Amoris！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "（記憶……在一點點消失……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "（最後一點關於她的回憶，也在慢慢被抹除……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "（那首歌……那首歌……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "（靈魂之歌……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "（我說……你屬於我……你屬於我……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "（看吧……分明近在咫尺……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "（光……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "（你就像光一樣……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "（你總有力量，讓大家聚在你的身邊，享受你的光芒和溫暖……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "text": "（這就是你啊……小祥。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一遍遍地演奏，內心一遍遍地呼喊，不曾停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "……很抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "很抱歉，我曾經無數次傷害過你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "但此時此刻，我比任何人都想見到你們——見到真實的你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "Ave{@nbs}Mujica是命運共同體。因為肩負著你們的人生，所以我也會賭上人生來守護你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "拜託了……各位，請醒過來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "午夜，雙月懸於夜空之上，當為人偶甦醒之時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "text": "重啟吧……Ave{@nbs}Mujica的世界。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
